# What Does It Mean To Study the Humanities in a Farm School Context?

**Authors:** Ewert-Krocker, Laurie

## Abstract
Describes the implementation of a humanities program in the context of a developing Erdkinder program in a Montessori secondary school set on a farm. Describes the curricular approach for the developing Erdkinder learning community in the first 3 years. Discusses adolescents' need to dramatize, fictionalize, and role-play to connect with other cultures. (KB)

